<v Katrin Weber>Okay, actions. I'll write the lessons learned in the implementation playbook for Germany.</v>

00:11:30.028 --> 00:11:37.465
<v Jonas Peeters>And the status page on the wiki? I looked last week, it still says April for payroll and Protime.</v>

00:11:37.895 --> 00:11:45.332
<v Katrin Weber>Yes, sorry, I know. I'll update the status page this week. It still has the old plan from February.</v>

